Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.90,OP,,0,0,0,,好勝其實是認真的證明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:07.57,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算這麼說，你也不會相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:10.11,OP,,0,0,0,,所謂的常識，有時只是枷鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.82,OP,,0,0,0,,正因為未知，才更值得去挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:15.41,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士，還是路邊的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:17.91,OP,,0,0,0,,為了找到答案，我選擇迎戰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:23.21,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃燒的熱情如閃電般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:28.80,OP,,0,0,0,,無論你變成什麼模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:33.09,OP,,0,0,0,,並肩作戰的意志絕不動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:37.93,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:43.18,OP,,0,0,0,,只為遇見令人熱血沸騰的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:50.07,OP,,0,0,0,,來吧，用刀鋒指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:55.24,OP,,0,0,0,,喚醒內心溫柔的強悍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:03:00.12,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸騰燃燒的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:04.54,OP,,0,0,0,,將絕望的氣息一刀斬斷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.46,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用這把“真劍”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:28.12,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷電擊中，內心翻騰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:36.04,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的預感，第一次在心底悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.63,ED,,0,0,0,,努力過後的冰淇淋獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.68,ED,,0,0,0,,在特別的日子裡分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.55,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此擺出美味的神情對視
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:51.64,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.48,ED,,0,0,0,,這些閃閃發光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.61,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:03.74,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在許願，像是在祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:07.45,ED,,0,0,0,,細細地品味每一個瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:11.37,ED,,0,0,0,,在樸素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地點綴色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:19.38,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你沒辦法，離不開你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.22,ED,,0,0,0,,這股讓人無法抗拒的悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那顆珠子就交給你保管了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一直都放在身邊嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我也學會了新招式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸,決勝負吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再見囉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事的話,就給我爬過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到時候我會親自奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刃,快抓好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,撐住,長竹竿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是哪裡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加,你振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大事不妙,她喝下太多水了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生,趕快進行人工呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼是人工呼吸?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴對嘴把氣吹進去,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以這麼做嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,動作快,不然會來不及
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛耶,幹嘛打我?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,還敢說我,你剛才是不是想親我?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是親,是人工呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,還敢說這種話,你這個色鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才是不是有什麼東西?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來,這裡是哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是在城裡面才對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏他們呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在掉下來的時候分散了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,希望大家都平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看來沒辦法回到上面去了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(烤雞串)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎...怎麼了呱?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有...有怪物呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我怪物也太失禮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是鬼丸四天王其中一人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,燈籠鮟鱇烤雞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸四天王?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,奉鬼丸大人的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你們全都吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你剛才掉下來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要是害在下這張帥臉受傷\N你要怎麼賠?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣說不定反而更像個美男子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有精神是件好事,不錯唷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是什麼人?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,還不快現身
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我在這裡啊,這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是猴子嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,別看我這樣,我可是鬼丸四天王之一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸四天王
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,比鋼鐵還要堅硬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,比子彈還要迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,高樓大廈也能一躍而過
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,超級猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真會在那邊耍嘴皮子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了,你們也報上名來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那就說給你聽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,古今無雙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,天下第一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,讓哭鬧兒童安靜的風雲人物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,宮本武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,佐佐木小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,正是在下本人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在下的台詞吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,厚顏無恥!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,竟敢自稱古今無雙\N有沒有把在下看在眼裡啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這兩人竟然是我的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,連打發時間都嫌無聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,還真敢說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼怪力?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,別大意了,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}在下原本的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}是獲得雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}現在跟那傢伙合作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,當場把武藏除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或許更容易獲得想要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然把我們丟到這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,吾輩乃鬼丸四天王之一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,變色龍拿破崙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果乖乖交出雷神劍和雷神珠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那就姑且饒你們一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事就來搶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,讓你見識我的新招威力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吾輩的字典裡沒有“不可能”三個字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,無珠雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雷電...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,還不趕快把手放開
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,旋風劍!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,又消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎...怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你們站在一旁別動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以亂動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他在尋找敵人的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在那邊!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.63,0:09:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是...是替身?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,暴雨斬!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡,一直在那邊躲來躲去的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我有個好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼主意?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起來也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吾輩可不是那種會上這種當的...\N- 蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,糟...糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好,上鉤了,就是現在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡,讓我浪費這麼多力氣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你給我安分一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好,我抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刃,你不可以放開他喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你...你是我?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你...你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的是你吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎...怎麼一模一樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,原來他還能變身嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看招...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你還看不出來嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那個蠢蛋才是假貨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是假貨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你這假貨是怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,500乘以1000是多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,500乘以1000?50萬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,五億嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋,是50萬啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然會算錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛耶,幹嘛要打我?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就算外表可以模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但你模仿不了腦袋裡的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是假貨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因為刃根本不可能會答對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖就範吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,既然這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,刃先生,把我丟出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,海參踢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,吃我這招
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你踢歪了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,無珠雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雷電斬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,還真是個麻煩的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人該不會也...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他們沒問題嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我們得趕快會合才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,還挺會玩些有趣的把戲嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,光看那外表,沒想到竟然這麼強
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在下一直在等待這個時機
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想幹嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在下的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,打從一開始就不是擊退鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而是獲得雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,成為天下第一的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,起內鬨了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你終究只是殭屍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:13:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是身體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,連心靈也腐爛了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,用卑鄙的手段取勝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不打算靠自己的實力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而是仰賴雷神劍的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為靠那種方式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就能成為天下第一的武士嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,少囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,耍卑鄙可是你最拿手的伎倆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你就到此為止了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我們上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏,你覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是現在,武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,沒...沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,進行得很順利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,完全按照在下的作戰計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,作戰?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要騙敵人的話,就得先騙自己人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不都這麼說嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}算了,這次就當作是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,影...影虎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了,你們也乖乖認命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呱...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那...那是我重要的提燈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,快把提燈還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我要讓你們知道我的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,無珠雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雷電斬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,得...得救了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你們三個都沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這...這到底是怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,刃不是懂一點動物的語言嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙原本是一直追著我們的大猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,刃後來發現他只是想回叢林老家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,所以只要他肯帶我們來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刃就會告訴他回家的路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你帶路囉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的故鄉就在那個方向
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看來他們挺有一手的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧,蜘蛛男
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最後的四天王該出擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真讓人欲罷不能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸四天王還剩最後一隻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能輕鬆搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}還不能太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}他們說不定還設了其他陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕,大家快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,沙...沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,動作不要慢吞吞的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,刃...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,珠...珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,騙你的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,兩個蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,現在不是讓你們鬧的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好...好大一隻烏龜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙就是鬼丸四天王最後一人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,烏龜號
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑,蜘蛛男!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要攻擊囉,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,烏龜號有著500萬馬力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,可別太小看他喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,必殺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.76,0:19:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,烏龜車輪!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快...快逃!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是屋頂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙跑到哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我在這裡啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,最後一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抓穩了,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才超危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,雷神劍差點就被壓爛了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,已經爬不起來了是不是啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看我趁現在砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,變形
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,這正是烏龜號蜘蛛型態
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛拉Z
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看我踩扁你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,做好覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看你做了什麼好事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,被你弄到腳都纏在一起了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,知道厲害了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你活該,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你可終於來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,鐵刃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼...鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我等到都不耐煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.35,0:23:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,刃和鬼丸決勝負的時刻終於到來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.15,0:23:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不要輸給鬼丸喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,下集,雷神劍vs風神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我一定要打倒你,鬼丸
